ef90b5b0a09","order":5956},{"id":"fangji-e-5d21132500abcbda501a","title":"夏侯威为兖州刺史，年四十九十二月上旬得疾，自分必死，预作遗令及送丧之备；至下旬转差垂以平复，三十日日昃请纪纲大吏设酒谓建平之戒真必过矣；罢客之后合瞑疾动，夜半遂卒","accounts":[{"id":"fangji-a-5d21132500abcbda501a","label":"正文","text":"夏侯威为兖州刺史，年四十九十二月上旬得疾，自分必死，预作遗令及送丧之备；至下旬转差垂以平复，三十日日昃请纪纲大吏设酒谓建平之戒真必过矣；罢客之后合瞑疾动，夜半遂卒","evidence":["fangji-q-7effb8c74d8e462f0edd"]}],"participants":[{"person":"xiahoucao-p0021","role":"得疾而卒者","evidence":["fangji-q-7effb8c74d8e462f0edd"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"夏侯威四十九岁十二月上旬至三十日夜半","precision":"undated","basis":"保留原纪年及粒度；本账户未独立归一公元年，不继承相邻事件年份。","evidence":["fangji-q-7effb8c74d8e462f0edd"]},"ordering_evidence":"fangji-q-7effb8c74d8e462f0edd","order":5962}],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0021","name":"夏侯威","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o020","fangji-q-11eba4f0aef90b5b0a09","fangji-q-7effb8c74d8e462f0edd"],"facts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-f0036","label":"字","text":"季权","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0036-q"]}],"aliases":[{"text":"季权","evidence":["xiahoucao-f0036-q"]}],"mentions":[{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o020-xiahoucao-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o020"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-m-p010-xiahoucao-p0021","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-p010"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"fangji-q-11eba4f0aef90b5b0a09","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-9791e51cc766ce82c699","layer":"original","quote":"谓夏侯威曰〖2〗：“君四十九，位为州牧，而当有厄；厄若得过，可年至七十，致位公辅","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":188,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"fangji-q-7effb8c74d8e462f0edd","section":"chapter-029","block":"b-520ae656fd6307a6b564","layer":"original","quote":"夏侯威，为兖州刺史，年四十九，十二月上旬得疾。念建平之言，自分必死；预作遗令及送丧之备，咸使素办〖14〗。至下旬转差，垂以平复〖15〗。三十日日昃〖16〗，请纪纲大吏设酒〖17〗，曰：“吾所苦渐平。明日鸡鸣，年便五十；建平之戒，真必过矣！”威罢客之后，合瞑疾动〖18〗，夜半遂卒","section_title":"方伎传第二十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0064.xhtml","index":193,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":139},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o020d-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"霸弟威，官至兖州刺史。﹝二﹞威弟惠，乐安太守。﹝三﹞惠弟和，河南尹。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":127,"end":161},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-p010a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-601ab7fd0070bf74ddbe","layer":"pei","quote":"威字季权。任侠，贵历荆、兖二州刺史。子骏，并州刺史。次庄，淮南太守。","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-828802c8244185354471","start":10,"end":44},{"id":"xiahoucao-f0036-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-601ab7fd0070bf74ddbe","layer":"pei","quote":"威字季权","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-828802c8244185354471","start":10,"end":14},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o020","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-fa4c25b726867680170c","layer":"original","quote":"渊妻，太祖内妹〖12〗。长子衡，尚太祖弟海阳哀侯女，恩宠特隆。衡袭爵，转封安宁亭侯。黄初中，赐中子霸；太和中，赐霸四弟爵：皆关内侯。霸，正始中为讨蜀护军、右将军〖13〗，进封博昌亭侯。素为曹爽所厚，闻爽诛，自疑，亡入蜀。以渊旧勋，赦霸子，徙乐浪郡。﹝一﹞霸弟威，官至兖州刺史。﹝二﹞威弟惠，乐安太守。﹝三﹞惠弟和，河南尹。﹝四﹞衡薨，子绩嗣，为虎贲中郎将。绩薨。子褒嗣。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":85,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-p010","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-601ab7fd0070bf74ddbe","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《世语》曰：“威字季权。任侠，贵历荆、兖二州刺史。子骏，并州刺史。次庄，淮南太守。庄子湛，字孝若；以才博文章，至南阳相、散骑常侍。庄，晋景（阳）〔羊〕皇后姊夫也。由此一门侈盛于时。”","attribution":"《世语》","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":102,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-828802c8244185354471","start":0,"end":94}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
